## Email notifications

### On submit (`sendPurchaseRequestEmails_`)
- Requester gets confirmation email
- **Budget + Supplier approvers only** receive approval-request email on submit
- Contract and Purchasing approvers are **not emailed at submit time**

### On stage transition (`sendPurchaseRequestStageEmail_`)
- Contract approver is emailed when parallel phase completes (both budget + supplier approved)
- Purchasing approver is emailed when contract phase completes (or parallel completes if contract not assigned)

### On completion (`sendPurchaseRequestCompletionEmail_`)
- Requester notified when PR reaches `Hoàn thành`

**Submit UX:** Spinner; **network `catch`** shows error toast (`submitForm`).

